0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 497.89 m 130 497.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 477.89 Tm (Nexus HMS shall be secure by default, operationally observable, responsive for normal hotel) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 463.89 Tm (workloads, maintainable by a TypeScript team, and deployable from a repeatable build. Requirements in) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 449.89 Tm (this document are targets and operating expectations. They should be measured in each production) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 435.89 Tm (environment rather than assumed from development results.) Tj ET
