BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 366.89 Tm (NFR-001 Response time) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 347.89 Tm (- Health checks should complete in under 250 ms when the database is healthy.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 326.89 Tm (- Normal authenticated list and detail requests should complete within 1 second at the 95th) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 312.89 Tm (  percentile under the agreed baseline load.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.89 Tm (- Dashboard and BI requests should complete within 2 seconds at the 95th percentile for a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 277.89 Tm (  single property and normal seeded data volume.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.89 Tm (- API requests that exceed the target should be visible through request-duration metrics.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.89 Tm (NFR-002 Throughput and throttling) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 208.89 Tm (- The default request throttle is 300 requests per minute per throttling key.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 187.89 Tm (- Production shall use Redis 7 with the Socket.IO Redis adapter so realtime packets can reach) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 173.89 Tm (  clients connected to different API replicas.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.89 Tm (- The Kubernetes baseline shall retain three API replicas and an HPA range of two to ten) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.89 Tm (  replicas.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 117.89 Tm (- Load tests should cover authentication, reservations, dashboard, search, reports, and mobile) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.89 Tm (  synchronization separately.) Tj ET
