BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 767.89 Tm (NFR-003 Caching) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 748.89 Tm (- Expensive dashboard and reservation reads may use a 60-second in-memory cache.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 727.89 Tm (- Cache entries shall have explicit expiry and invalidation behavior.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 706.89 Tm (- Cache flush is an administrative operation and shall be observable in audit logs where) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 692.89 Tm (  enabled.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 671.89 Tm (- The in-memory cache is process-local and shall not be described or operated as Redis-backed.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 657.89 Tm (  Cross-instance cache consistency is not provided.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 622.89 Tm (3. Availability and resilience) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 616.89 m 130 616.89 l S
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 588.89 Tm (NFR-004 Health and startup) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 569.89 Tm (- The API shall expose `/api/health` with a machine-readable status and timestamp.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.89 Tm (- A deployment shall use health checks for process readiness and liveness.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.89 Tm (- The application shall fail startup when the required MFA encryption secret is absent; it) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 513.89 Tm (  shall not silently fall back to a weak secret for MFA data.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 492.89 Tm (- The production API shall fail startup when `REDIS_URL` is absent so cross-replica Socket.IO) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.89 Tm (  delivery is not silently disabled.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.89 Tm (- Redis readiness checks and application connections shall authenticate; an unauthenticated) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 443.89 Tm (  Redis URL shall not be used.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 414.89 Tm (NFR-005 Failure behavior) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 395.89 Tm (- Invalid credentials, invalid tokens, invalid TOTP codes, forbidden administrative actions,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.89 Tm (  malformed input, and missing resources shall return explicit HTTP errors.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 360.89 Tm (- A failed security check shall not silently grant access.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.89 Tm (- A malformed stored IP rule shall be ignored safely and should be investigated through) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 325.89 Tm (  operational review.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.89 Tm (- A failed mobile synchronization request shall not advance the client's sync watermark.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.89 Tm (NFR-006 Recovery) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.89 Tm (- PostgreSQL backups shall be scheduled according to the hotel's recovery point objective.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.89 Tm (- Restore procedures shall be rehearsed in a non-production environment.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.89 Tm (- Deployments shall retain a previous application image or build so that rollback is possible) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.89 Tm (  without rebuilding from an unverified commit.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.89 Tm (- The Kubernetes 10Gi ReadWriteOnce uploads PVC shall use required API pod affinity to) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 165.89 Tm (  co-locate API replicas on one node. Multi-node placement shall not be enabled until shared) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.89 Tm (  filesystem or object storage replaces that boundary.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.89 Tm (4. Security and privacy) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 110.88999999999999 m 130 110.88999999999999 l S
