BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (- JWT access tokens shall be required for protected routes.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 754.89 Tm (- MFA-pending tokens shall be cryptographically distinct from full access tokens and shall) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 740.89 Tm (  have a short lifetime.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 719.89 Tm (- Refresh tokens shall use a separate signing secret derived from the session secret.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 698.89 Tm (- Role and tenant scope shall be evaluated server-side; client-side navigation is not an) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 684.89 Tm (  authorization boundary.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.89 Tm (NFR-008 Secret and credential protection) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 636.89 Tm (- `SESSION_SECRET` shall be supplied through the environment secret store.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 615.89 Tm (- `REDIS_PASSWORD` and the credential-bearing `REDIS_URL` shall be supplied through the) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 601.89 Tm (  environment secret store and shall contain matching credentials.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 580.89 Tm (- Real production should use managed Redis on a private network with TLS and a `rediss://`) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 566.89 Tm (  URL. The included internal Redis service shall not be represented as TLS-enabled.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 545.89 Tm (- MFA TOTP secrets and backup codes shall be encrypted at rest with AES-256-GCM using a key) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 531.89 Tm (  derived from `SESSION_SECRET`.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 510.89 Tm (- Backup codes shall be one-time use.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 489.89 Tm (- Secrets, access tokens, refresh tokens, QR payloads, and backup codes shall not be written) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 475.89 Tm (  to logs.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 454.89 Tm (- Production systems shall not use demo credentials or a default session secret.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 425.89 Tm (NFR-009 Network protection) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 406.89 Tm (- Helmet shall be enabled for standard HTTP security headers.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 385.89 Tm (- CORS shall be configured to the approved application origins in production rather than left) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.89 Tm (  broadly permissive.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.89 Tm (- The Prometheus metrics endpoint is public by design for scrape compatibility and shall be) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.89 Tm (  restricted at the ingress, firewall, or network-policy layer.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 315.89 Tm (- IP restriction rules shall accept only validated IPv4 addresses or IPv4 CIDR notation.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 294.89 Tm (- Kubernetes NetworkPolicies shall allow Redis ingress only from API pods on TCP 6379 and deny) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 280.89 Tm (  all Redis egress.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.89 Tm (- Kubernetes Redis and web containers shall run as non-root, disallow privilege escalation,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.89 Tm (  and drop all Linux capabilities.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 216.89 Tm (NFR-010 Data isolation) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 197.89 Tm (- Tenant-aware services shall filter by authenticated tenant context.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.89 Tm (- No service shall return cross-tenant core hotel rows while a safe tenant_id filter is) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.89 Tm (  unavailable.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 141.89 Tm (- A future core-table tenant migration shall include indexes, backfill, constraints, and a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 127.89 Tm (  verification plan before tenant operational sync is enabled.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 92.89 Tm (5. Observability) Tj ET
