0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 324.89 m 130 324.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.89 Tm (- Cache is process-local rather than Redis-backed.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 283.89 Tm (- Event delivery uses an in-process EventEmitter2 bus rather than RabbitMQ or Kafka.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 262.89 Tm (- Redis 7 is used only as the Socket.IO cross-replica backplane; it is not a shared cache or) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 248.89 Tm (  durable EventBus.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.89 Tm (- Included Compose and Kubernetes Redis use password authentication without TLS;) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 213.89 Tm (  managed/private TLS Redis is the recommendation for real production.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.89 Tm (- Search uses PostgreSQL ILIKE rather than Elasticsearch.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.89 Tm (- Kubernetes upload storage is a 10Gi ReadWriteOnce volume with required pod affinity) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 157.89 Tm (  co-locating API pods on one node; multi-node operation requires shared or object storage.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 136.89 Tm (- Push tokens are stored, but FCM/APNs delivery is not implemented.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.89 Tm (- Core table tenant columns are incomplete; safe empty responses are preferred over unsafe) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 101.89 Tm (  data exposure.) Tj ET
